# duckduckgo-mcp (DEPRECATED)

**This package has been renamed to [`web-forager`](https://pypi.org/project/web-forager/).**

Install the new package instead:

```bash
pip install web-forager
```

The CLI command is now `web-forager`:

```bash
web-forager serve
web-forager search "your query"
```

See the [Web Forager repository](https://github.com/CyranoB/web-forager) for documentation.
